Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div id="demoPlayer" style="display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 10px; background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 6px;">
